><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250709133249+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250709133255+10'00'" name="03ee680a-7a87-48f2-aab4-aeeea553b9d8" page="5" coords="60.000107,626.109863,275.726440,626.109863,60.000107,614.909485,275.726440,614.909485,60.000107,615.108887,267.091309,615.108887,60.000107,603.908508,267.091309,603.908508,60.000107,604.107910,276.410583,604.107910,60.000107,592.907532,276.410583,592.907532,60.000107,593.106934,105.875626,593.106934,60.000107,581.906555,105.875626,581.906555,60.000107,582.109863,264.383331,582.109863,60.000107,570.909485,264.383331,570.909485,47.998108,581.332458,55.918152,581.332458,47.998108,570.684509,55.918152,570.684509,56.038101,580.716370,57.958145,580.716370,56.038101,571.284485,57.958145,571.284485,60.000107,571.108887,276.648438,571.108887,60.000107,559.908508,276.648438,559.908508,60.000107,560.107910,83.189636,560.107910,60.000107,548.907532,83.189636,548.907532,60.000107,549.109863,281.369720,549.109863,60.000107,537.909485,281.369720,537.909485,47.998108,548.332458,55.918152,548.332458,47.998108,537.684509,55.918152,537.684509,55.918106,547.716370,57.838150,547.716370,55.918106,538.284485,57.838150,538.284485,60.000107,538.108887,232.492981,538.108887,60.000107,526.908508,232.492981,526.908508,48.000198,509.489685,262.965210,509.489685,48.000198,498.184814,262.965210,498.184814,60.000198,487.531738,262.730865,487.531738,60.000198,476.331390,262.730865,476.331390,47.998199,486.754364,55.918243,486.754364,47.998199,476.106415,55.918243,476.106415,55.918198,486.138275,57.838242,486.138275,55.918198,476.706390,57.838242,476.706390,60.000198,476.530762,260.421265,476.530762,60.000198,465.330383,260.421265,465.330383,60.000198,465.531738,257.638550,465.531738,60.000198,454.331390,257.638550,454.331390,47.998199,464.754364,55.918243,464.754364,47.998199,454.106415,55.918243,454.106415,55.918198,464.138275,57.838242,464.138275,55.918198,454.706390,57.838242,454.706390,60.000198,454.530762,278.918549,454.530762,60.000198,443.330383,278.918549,443.330383,60.000198,443.529724,274.177917,443.529724,60.000198,432.329376,274.177917,432.329376,60.000198,432.528748,221.415802,432.528748,60.000198,421.328369,221.415802,421.328369" rect="47.646912,420.978333,281.719727,626.459900" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Time cost of rib stress injury is in excess of previous findings&#xD;in the elite rower with fractures taking median of 69 days&#xD;(IQR 56–157) to return to full training and reactions 57 days&#xD;(IQR 45–78).&#xD;</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-10.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>►► </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Females have a tendency toward increased prevalence,&#xD;but not statistically significant increase in risk of rib stress&#xD;injury.&#xD;</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-10.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>►► </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>No athlete with rib stress injury in the Olympiad won a medal&#xD;in the year of their injury or at the Rio Olympics.</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal"
>&#xD;</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-10.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>►► </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>MRI should be considered first line imaging for rib stress&#xD;injury in elite athletes, to reduce lifetime radiation dose.&#xD;</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-10.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>►► </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>The incidence and prevalence of rib stress injury is now&#xD;established in Australian Olympic level rowers and this offers&#xD;a baseline to measure the effectiveness of injury prevention&#xD;interventions in all elite rowing programmes.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="5" rect="595.276001,534.109863,779.276001,626.109863"
/></highlight
